          "text": "<p>The minimum number of 2-input NAND gates required to implement a 2-input XOR gate is</p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li>$4$</li><li>$5$</li><li>$6$</li><li>$7$</li></ol>",
