          "text": "<p>Without any additional circuitry, an $8:1$ MUX can be used to obtain</p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li>some but not all Boolean functions of $3$ variables</li><li>all functions of $3$ variables but none of $4$ variables</li><li>all functions of $3$ variables and some but not all of $4$ variables</li><li>all functions of $4$ variables</li></ol>",
